Accept the candidate 
\begin_inset Formula $x^{\star}$
\end_inset

 if
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
u<\frac{p(x^{\star})}{M\cdot q(x^{\star})}
\]

\end_inset

Otherwise, reject the candidate and return to step 1.
\end_layout

